  "kappa_definition": "binary REM-vs-not \u03ba against the PSG consensus (BOAS stage_hum); not five-class",
  "labels": "stage_hum: 0 wake, 1 to 3 nrem, 4 REM; 8 (PSG disconnection), -2 and missing are not scored",
  "limitations": [
    "transfer_not_muse: a Bitbrain Ikon headband referenced to the mastoid, not a Muse referenced near Fpz",
    "eeg_only: the headband IMU is not in the units its files name, so the detector runs without its stillness term and the gate without motion blocks",
    "binary_kappa: REM against not REM, not five-class",
    "offline_stagers: GSSC and YASA read the whole night; their latency is not that of a causal gate",
    "stage_ai_trained_on_boas: stage_ai comes from Bitbrain's network, trained on BOAS itself in cross-validation folds; it is context, not a baseline"
  ],
